Subject: [PATCH 26/26] hw/hyperv: let the render device's PCI identity be set

Give gpupv-render vendor-id and device-id properties. They default to the
Microsoft identity Windows' own virtual render driver binds to, and a guest
that holds a driver package for another identity can be shown that one.
---
 hw/hyperv/gpupv.c | 16 ++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hw/hyperv/gpupv.c b/hw/hyperv/gpupv.c
